Description: semantic word search engine with a MeiliSearch-compatible API
 WordSwift is a word embedding engine derived from fastText that also provides
 full-text BM25 search, typo-tolerant fuzzy search, prefix completion, and
 semantic word similarity through a single MeiliSearch-compatible REST API.
 .
 Features:
  * CBOW and skip-gram training with subword n-gram hashing
  * Word analogies and nearest-neighbour lookup via cosine similarity
  * LevelDB-backed persistence for vectors and full-text posting lists
  * Typo tolerance using Damerau-Levenshtein distance with transpositions
  * Multi-index management and a CLI for training and querying
 .
 This package installs the wordswift command line tool and a systemd service
 that listens on 127.0.0.1:7700 by default. The service has no built-in
 authentication, so do not expose it to untrusted networks without a reverse
 proxy in front of it.
 .
 python3-plyvel is a hard dependency because without it the storage layer
 silently falls back to in-memory dictionaries and indexes do not survive a
 restart.
